SRVLX;cmdargs;port;z;runtime;⎕ELX
SRVInitGlobals
SRVMakeForm

⎕ELX←'''I'' SRVLog ∊⎕DM ⋄ ⎕DL 10 ⋄ ''fmAFS'' ⎕WI ''Wait'''
runtime←⎕SYS[21]

'I' SRVLog 'AFS Starting up'
'I' SRVLog 'W_Init: ',3⊃⎕WCALL 'W_Init'

:If 0=port←↑⎕FI GetCmdArg 'CFSPORT'
    SRVExit 'CFSPORT not found on command line'
:EndIf


:If 0≠↑z←SQAInit ''
    SRVExit 'Unable to initialise SQAPL: ',⍕z
:EndIf

:If 0=SOCK←SRVConnect port
    SRVExit 'Unable to connect'
:EndIf

:If runtime
   'fmAFS' ⎕WI 'Wait'
:EndIf